{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One must imagine Sisyphus <i>wealthy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on the famous Greek myth, now YOU can also roll a boulder indefinitely! Earn money, unlock upgrades and collect decorations for your customizable boulder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/extras/Sisyphus_GIF__616x347_.gif?t=1751066026\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simply click and hold to roll</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique art style inspired by ancient Greek pottery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach speeds of up to hundreds of kilometers per hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9+ different unlockable Boulders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16+ humorous unlockable Stickers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Backgrounds and Styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">27 Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive sounds and ambience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo-developed</strong> with <strong>NO generative tools!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470640?t=1751066026","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470640?t=1751066026","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/7488f16a14172c6fd57f6b7985c4dee9c2172ce5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751066026","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470640/7488f16a14172c6fd57f6b7985c4dee9c2172ce5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751066026","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":6